Part of this system will involve adding more in-depth statistics for each hero, this would include the following&#x20;
Attack/Defense/Move speed/Vision radius/resistance/Health regen/Mining rate/Type of monster advantage/Spells/Weapons/Drop rate/ Attack rate&#x20;

All of these states provide depth for character development. Since this is a large change lets break this down into work items that luna can do combined with ones that are more suitable to a model of your intellect such as deciding balance and interactions.

